ant)\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">// 反射能在运行时看类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">t </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">:=</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> reflect.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">TypeOf</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">(x)     </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">// int</span></span></code></pre>",
